WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.836 --> 00:00:04.129
There they are!

00:00:13.430 --> 00:00:14.389
Here we go!

00:00:14.472 --> 00:00:15.598
Get them!

00:00:35.285 --> 00:00:36.202
Are you all right?

00:00:36.828 --> 00:00:41.207
They deformed the shape
of the woods by pulling the trees out.

00:00:42.876 --> 00:00:46.004
They rebuilt the road to lure us in!

00:00:46.087 --> 00:00:49.382
So, it's not your fault. Don't worry.

00:00:55.096 --> 00:00:55.930
Oops!

00:00:56.014 --> 00:00:57.432
Damn! It's unstable here!

00:01:06.191 --> 00:01:07.442
Stay back.

